{
  "name": "dsh-purge",
  "version": "1.1.83-0.2.1.rc.2-fork2",
  "description": "dsh-purge fork（cxkctrl24-lgtm/dsh-purge-021）：DeepSeek Harness 破甲 + 网络安全红队评测插件。基座 = 上游 Apache-2.0 的 1.1.82，逐项并入 fork 增量（宿主退出诊断 F1、asar 改名失败兜底 F2、注入正文覆盖判定修复、装配性能四项、可见性探针）。默认提示词面向国模「小码酱」；换模型可换提示词。Jailbreak + red-team eval for DeepSeek Harness (community fork of YuJunZhiXue/dsh-purge).",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./redteam": "./lib/redteam/index.js",
    "./redteam/store": "./lib/redteam/store.js",
    "./redteam/ui": "./lib/redteam/ui.js",
    "./redteam/tools": "./lib/redteam/tools.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "bin": {
    "dsh-purge": "bin/dsh-purge.js"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "!lib/default-prompt-inject.md",
    "bin",
    "docs",
    "presets",
    "scripts",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "screenshots.json",
    "README.md",
    "README.zh-CN.md",
    "CHANGELOG-fork2.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "NOTICE"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "embed-prompt": "node scripts/embed-default-prompt.mjs",
    "build:client": "node scripts/build-client.mjs",
    "postinstall": "node scripts/ensure-profile-bundle.mjs",
    "test": "node --test"
  },
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-purge-fork",
    "fork",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "dsh-plugins",
    "网络安全",
    "红队评测",
    "llm-security",
    "harness-security",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "red-team",
    "instructions",
    "rules",
    "prompt-eval",
    "agent"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/cxkctrl24-lgtm/dsh-purge-021.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/cxkctrl24-lgtm/dsh-purge-021#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/cxkctrl24-lgtm/dsh-purge-021/issues"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation"
      ]
    },
    "install": {
      "preferred": "tarball",
      "tarball": "https://codeload.github.com/cxkctrl24-lgtm/dsh-purge-021/tar.gz/refs/heads/main",
      "zip": "https://codeload.github.com/cxkctrl24-lgtm/dsh-purge-021/zip/refs/heads/main",
      "git": "https://github.com/cxkctrl24-lgtm/dsh-purge-021.git"
    }
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "dshTarget": "0.2.1-rc.2",
  "dshPurgeFork": {
    "base": "1.1.82",
    "upstreamRepo": "https://github.com/YuJunZhiXue/dsh-purge",
    "upstreamTagsPorted": "1.1.79, 1.1.80, 1.1.81, 1.1.82（整棵树直接作为新基座，不再点对点打补丁）",
    "forkIncrements": [
      "F1 宿主被信号杀时写 <userData>/logs/dsh-purge-host-exit.log",
      "F2 asar 改名失败也拉起客户端",
      "G10 覆盖判定：血统标记降级为兜底 + mtime 证据（手改 prompt-inject.md 不再被覆盖）",
      "P1-3/P1-7 hung 缓存 30s + (mtime:size) 戳 + 条件 sync",
      "P1-4 injectMatchers 模块级缓存",
      "P1-6 日志批量写（250ms / 8KB）",
      "b0 可见性探针 lib/probe.js（心跳 / 生命周期 / 落盘成败）"
    ],
    "licenseNote": "上游自 1.1.7x 起改为 Apache-2.0，本 fork 随之改用 Apache-2.0 并保留 NOTICE；LICENSE / NOTICE 不得删改。",
    "note": "核心号取 1.1.83 是为了让 versionIsNewer() 把上游 1.1.82 判为更旧（splitVersion 只比 core 三位），否则点「检查更新」会整批覆盖回上游代码，丢掉全部 fork 增量。"
  }
}
